ial instruments that are measured at fair values, as explained in the accounting policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:708.05pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.52pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;below. Historical cost is generally based on the fair value of the consideration given in exchange for the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:28.4pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfBasisOfPreparationOfFinancialStatementsExplanatory>
