sition:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:440.89pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;in the same period or periods during which the hedged expected future cash flows affect profit or loss. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.39pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:177pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:112.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:440.88pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;gains or losses from hedging instruments relating to the ineffective portion are recognized immediately in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.38pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:189pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:112.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:53.58pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;profit or loss.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:no