y December &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);top:17.76pt;width:86.25pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:32.12pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre"&gt;2030&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:708.7pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.4pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;The long-term bank loans of the Company are used for plants setup, procurement of machinery and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.38pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:721.9pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.42pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;equipment, and operating capital. The partial long-term bank loans are with preferential interest rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.4pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:45pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.51pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;subsidized by the government, and the loans are used to fund capital expenditure qualifying for the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.49pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:58.2pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:36.36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;subsidy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:119.34pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:77.4pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.52pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;The Company is required to maintain certain financial covenants during the borrowing period, including&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:90.6pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.37pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;the annual equity of the subsidiary receiving the partial loan not to fall below a specific amount; its debt-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:103.8pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.4pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;to-equity ratio must not exceed a certain ratio; and the ratio of the Company&#x2019;s annual debt to earnings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.38pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:424.92pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization (EBITDA) not to exceed a certain multiple.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfBorrowingsExplanatory>
