="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:244.54000000000002pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:48.75pt"&gt;3.2 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:293.29pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:260.2pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; shares. TSMC has completed this share buyback program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.49pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:96.6pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:107.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:445.93pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;during the second quarter of 2024. On August 13, 2024, TSMC&#x2019;s Board of Directors resolved to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.39pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:109.8pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:107.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:47.82pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;cancel the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:155.28pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:48.66pt"&gt;3.2 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:203.94pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:349.52pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; shares and set September 1, 2024 as the record date for capital reduction. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:123pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:107.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:323.33pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;registration for share cancellation was completed on September 11, 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfShareCapitalReservesAndOtherEquityInterestExplanatory>
