:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:148.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:390.22pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;the employee remains employed by the Company on the last date of each vesting period;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:538.72pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:700.9pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:126pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.85pt"&gt;&#x2022;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:148.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:404.91pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;during the vesting period, the employee may not breach any agreement with the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.4100000000001pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:714.1pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;l