    <ifrs-full:DisclosureOfGovernmentGrantsExplanatory contextRef="c-1" id="f-3042">&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:83.25pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre"&gt;GOVERNMENT GRANTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:213.04pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:367.25pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.52pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;Subsidiaries such as TSMC Arizona, ESMC, JASM and TSMC Nanjing received subsidies from the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:380.45pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.49pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;governments of the United States, Germany, Japan and China, respectively, for local plant setup and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.47pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:393.65pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;operation, which were mainly used to subsidize the purchase costs of property, plant and equipment as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.48pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:406.85pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.38pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;well as partial costs and expenses incurred from plant construction and production. For the years ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.36pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-s