    <ifrs-full:DisclosureOfObjectivesPoliciesAndProcessesForManagingCapitalExplanatory contextRef="c-1" id="f-3089">&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:83.25pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre"&gt;CAPITAL MANAGEMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:218.53pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:70.2pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.4pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;The objective of the Company&#x2019;s capital management is to maintain a capital structure that ensures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.38pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:83.4pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.47pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;liquidity and supports a solid investment grade credit rating. The capital structure includes both debt and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:96.6pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:470.52pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;equity. The Company adjusts its capital structure mainly through changes in the level of debt and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:109.8pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:210.71pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;adjustments of dividend payout to shareholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:293.69pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:135pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:307.1pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;The Company&#x2019;s capital management policy remained unchanged in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:390.08000000000004pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:22pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:412.08000000000004pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:141.33pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;. TSMC&#x2019;s current credit ratings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.41pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:82.98pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:62.58pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;are AA- from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:145.56pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:89.78pt"&gt;S&amp;amp;P Global Ratings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-s