y. If any party defaults on the commitment and the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.36pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:71.4pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:107.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:445.91pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;capacity utilization of SSMC falls below a specific percentage of its capacity, the defaulting party is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.37pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:11pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:84.6pt;width:612pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:107.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:445.96pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:inherit"&gt;required to compensate SSMC for all related unavoidable costs. There was no default from the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.42pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.75pt"&gt;&l